# The menus on a desktop: every picker and panel opens and closes, the
# settings change, a Practice settlement builds and undoes, a Journey stage is
# paused, restarted, left and resumed from its autosave.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Daily Trail
frames 30
click =Challenges
until 300 Against the Sun
expect Road limit: 10 tiles.
frames 10
click =← Back
until 300 Daily Trail
frames 10
click =Daily Trail
until 300 One shared map for everyone today.
expect Ranked
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 300 Daily Trail
frames 10
click =Scores
until 300 Scoreboards
expect No scores yet
frames 5
click =Daily
until 300 Today’s shared seed.
frames 5
click =✕ Close
until 300 Daily Trail
frames 10
click =Help
until 300 How to play
expect Trade orders
frames 5
key Escape 1
frames 10
click =Settings
until 300 Day length (timing assistance)
frames 5
click =Default
frames 10
click =Deuteranopia-safe
frames 10
expect Deuteranopia-safe
save menus-settings
click =✕ Close
until 300 Daily Trail
frames 10
click =Practice
until 300 Unranked, undo enabled.
frames 10
click Start Relaxed
until 300 Day 0 / 45
frames 150
# Road tool, one step up from the hall, build; undo it
key Digit2 1
key ArrowUp 1
key Enter 1
frames 5
until 120 Road built.
expect ↩
key KeyU 1
frames 5
until 120 1. [D0] Settlement founded.
key Escape 1
frames 5
key Escape 1
until 120 Restart scenario
frames 5
click =Leave settlement
until 300 Resume saved settlement
frames 10
click =↩ Resume saved settlement
until 300 Welcome back
frames 10
expect Practice
key Space 1
frames 5
expect ▶▶
key Escape 1
until 120 Restart scenario
frames 5
click =Restart scenario
until 300 Day 0 / 45
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 120 Leave settlement
frames 5
click =Help
until 300 How to play
frames 5
click =✕ Close
frames 10
click =Resume
frames 10
expect Day 0 / 45
